      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a1fe7a-3445-744c-94d1-094a08c8ff5e -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Concurrent console startup can fail on a version-1 database\n\nTwo consoles can read `user_version = 1` before either migrates, causing the second to run migration `002` after the first has dropped `legacy_format`.\n\nThe second console exits with a SQLite error before dispatching its command.\n\nAcquire a write transaction with `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` before reading `user_version`, and apply migrations without releasing that lock.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Details</summary>\n\nBefore this change, the stale version check could race during initial schema creation, but a version-1 database had no pending migration.\n\n</details>\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a1fe4f-49f1-7732-81cb-f1d6ad806605/reviews/01a1fe78-fb61-702e-b451-dfed837fc368/findings/01a1fe7a-344c-713c-a5cd-4e3a91e4c8b1)\n\nAlso at:\n- [`console.py`](https://github.com/hasansyed-proofline/bench-proofline/blob/420baea889887b127f1c87d99f728e40f7664996/console.py#L29-L35) lines 29 to 35\n- [`reports.py`](https://github.com/hasansyed-proofline/bench-proofline/blob/420baea889887b127f1c87d99f728e40f7664996/reports.py#L68-L75) lines 68 to 75",
